          <td colspan="2" height="30" background="newsheader.jpg"><font face="Times New Roman" size="4"><b><font size="5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A busy few days for SoF . . .</font></b></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr bgcolor="#330033"> 
          <td width="60%"><font size="2"><i><font face="Verdana">by <A href="javascript:createWindow('memberdetails.asp?id=33','profile','scrollbars,width=550,height=500')"><font color=yellow>Kayel </font></a></font></i></font></td>
          <td width="40%"> 
            <div align="right"><font size="2"><b>Posted: 2/2/2002 2:58:51 AM</b></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>Fear raids, epic raids, dragon keeeling, Moonwolf dying . . . SoF was busy again.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">This update will hopefully catch up on the news of the last few days.  The first order is to congratulate Rayge on his brand new shiney:<br><br>SPEAR OF FATE <br>Classes: Shamans<br>Races: Trolls, Ogres, Barbarians, Iksar<br>Type: Piercing<br>Damage: 20 Delay: 30<br>Stats: +70 MANA +30 HP +10 STR +10 DEX +10 STA +20 WIS +10 SV COLD +10 SV DISEASE +10 SV FIRE +10 SV MAGIC +10 SV POISON<br>Special Attributes: MAGIC, NO DROP, LORE<br>Effect: Curse of Spirits <br><br>Along on the same raid, we'd like to grats Quxeous on her:<br><br>Ornate Rune Shield <br>Races: ALL - Classes: NEC WIZ MAG ENC (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 15 - Wt: 3 - Slot: shield<br>Attributes: INT+8 MANA+10 SV POISON+5 SV DISEASE+5 SV COLD+5 SV FIRE+5 SV MAGIC+5 <br><br>And a quick grats out to Cuisenorc on his:<br><br>Atramentous Shield<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM<br>Slot: SHIELD<br>AC: 28   WT: 3.0<br>STR+5  STA+5  INT+5  HP+50  MANA+50  SV COLD+5  SV FIRE+5  SV MAGIC+10  <br>Effect: Deadeye<br>Class: SHD <br><br>This was followed by some XP'ing the next day, with some lewtz for Hannem of a brand new:<br><br>Withered Leather Tunic<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM<br>Slot: CHEST<br>AC: 11   WT: 3.5<br>WIS+4  MANA+90  SV MAGIC+10  <br>Class: CLR DRU SHM <br>Race: ALL <br><br>After that, we all rushed off to the Plane of Fear into which we brought death and destruction.  Many drops ensued, Cuisenorc made out like Xmas with most of a suit of Umbral.  The most notable tidbit of course being the last major hurdle on EPICURUS's epic- grats on your Broken Golem!  We just need to tag VS and voila, another guild epic.<br><br>Then we rushed to Cobalt Scar because we'd heard Kelorek Dar was up, but Requiem of Souls beat us too it.  Grats on your drops guys!<br><br>Not to be daunted, we wandered down to SEBELIS to visit the UNDEAD BARD for HEXUM's epic.  Our numbers were a bit low so we called in support from friends, and a ton of extra help from CLAN ICEWIND.  Thanks for showing up guys.  Trakanon died in under 15 seconds, and a HUGE GRATS OUT TO HEXUM on:<br><br>Singing Short Sword<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  NO DROP<br>Skill: 1HS   Atk Delay: 26<br>DMG: 16   WT: 2.0   Dmg/Sec: 12.69<br>STR+15  DEX+10  STA+10  CHA+15  HP+50  MANA+10  SV POISON+10  SV DISEASE+10  SV COLD+10  SV FIRE+10  SV MAGIC+10  <br>Effect: Dance Of The Blade (AE Group Buff: 55% haste, +30 STR, +30 ATK, 2.5 minutes)<br>  <br>However, Trakanon was not without other lewtz, grats out to BHHAAL on  his:<br><br>Cloak of Piety <br>LORE ITEM MAGIC ITEM NO DROP  <br>AC: +12 Str: +12 Wis: +12 Int: +12 Magic Resist: +10 Fire Resist: +10  <br>Weight: 1.5 <br>Effect:  HASTE <br><br>And, huge style points and thanks to Bhhaal for passing down his SEBESILIAN Cloak to Kayel!<br><br>All in all a busy few days.  Nice work all!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              </font>
</td>
